      "minutes": 6,
      "instruction": "Boil the kettle. Zest and juice the lemon. Slice the garlic."
    },
    {
      "minutes": 12,
      "instruction": "Boil the orzo in the water with half the salt until it is almost tender. Add the peas for the last 2 minutes, then drain, saving a splash of the water.",
