    },
    {
      "minutes": 6,
      "instruction": "Meanwhile warm half the oil and fry the salmon, skin-side down if it has skin, until it flakes. Break it into large pieces.",
      "heat": "medium hob"
    },
    {
      "minutes": 4,
      "instruction": "In the pasta pan, warm the rest of the oil and the garlic for 30 seconds. Toss in the orzo, peas, spinach, lemon zest and juice, parsley and a splash of the cooking water.",
